OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after collision with
OL,4,Aambulance
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died after being involved in
OL,7,Fa collision with an ambulance in
OL,8,FSheffield.
OL,10,FSouth Yorkshire Police said officers
OL,11,Fwere called to reports of road traffic
OL,12,Fcollision in Myrtle Road involving a
OL,13,F26-year-old man and the vehicle at
OL,14,F18:41 BST on Wednesday.
OL,16,FA spokesperson said medical staff
OL,17,Fperformed CPR on the man but he died as
OL,18,Fa result of his injuries.
OL,20,FPolice said the ambulance driver had
OL,21,Fremained at the scene to assist
OL,22,Fofficers with their inquiries.
